msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Hello there, Kiryu-san. Are you headed somewhere special?\r\n"
"You're dressed to the nines, as they say! Haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll actually be out of town for a little while.\r\n"
"Headed up to Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"I see. Thankfully, your children are some of the most\r\n"
"responsible little rascals in town. I'm sure they'll be just\r\n"
"fine on their own while you're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Well, enjoy your trip!"
msgstr ""

